// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1492952870" "Thank you all for coming."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1530071804" "As you all know, our efforts to contain and utilize the power of Pandora's Box to our own ends have been frustrated, primarily by one person: Gerhardt Eisenstadt, otherwise known as Lord Nemesis."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P231241210" "In assessing the threat potential that Nemesis represents, including his newfound control over the power of Pandora, I have come to a single conclusion:"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3604584980" "Alone, our organization has a near-zero chance of defeating the Nemesis army in combat."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3376343966" "I can understand your sentiments, but I assure you. I have examined every possible scenario, and direct confrontation is simply not an option."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P935008228" "However..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1897467673" "I believe that if we were to temporarily join our cause with another like-minded organization, our chances would improve considerably."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1739855711" "For the time being, we will need to parley a truce... with Arachnos."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2520951773" "To do so, we will need to present a unified front. Among other things, that means that this organization can remain nameless no longer."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P942436319" "Odysseus"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2465821391" "<em laugh>Not known for your optimism, are you?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2454019074" "Ah. Of course. I see where this is going."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1379034422" "A name, huh..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1602654835" "A group that has ties to both Paragon and the Isles. A finger in every pie."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1545547383" "Oh ho ho... my dear captain, isn't that a bit ambitious?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1576366095" "Captain Castillo"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1385629026" "Preposterous!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P575865559" "Ah... I am getting the inspiration, I think!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3553735744" "Control from the shadows, a network of spies and cartels..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3376375628" "There is a name for this, yes? A legend of history."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2585359146" "Not at all! I believe it describes us to perfection!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2796270253" "{HeroName}, with your permission, I believe that our alliance should henceforth be called... the Illuminati!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2723758211" "Lieutenant Harriman"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2663371053" "Now hold on a second..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3601709970" "Let's not forget, we've got a double agent in Arachnos, too."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2601608608" "The way things are going, {HeroName}'s going to be a bona fide puppetmaster by year end."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3387131297" "Socrates"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1592126463" "Unthinkable!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2786030743" "I'm the start for the positions on Gang One"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P892451606" "I die!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P907243011" "I'm the end of the positions for gang one"
// Script Variable BOSS_3_DISPLAYNAME :
"P527778965" "Smasher Elite"
// Script Variable BOSS_6_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4248461223" "Assault Jump Bot"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3177773160" "Hello there."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2836457115" "Now you die!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1738482053" "Nevermind"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3148347594" "Ghost Widow"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3186239463" "For this rabble, our power will suffice!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2471610899" "Where IS he? The call went out twenty minutes ago!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1924859427" "No matter. We can deal with him later."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4105631639" "Black Scorpion"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P511573281" "No idea. I ain't his keeper."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2855812872" "Scirocco"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1992949347" "His unreliability does not surprise me in the least."

