"P3613379615" "You've negotiated a truce with Lord Recluse."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1999698791" "Welcome back! Have you adjusted psychologically to the idea of being ruled by an all-powerful dictator?<br><br>It can be quite the pill to swallow, but if you need them, I've got some helpful tips for you! Once you've acclimated to your new way of life, you'll be able to survive relatively pain-free in the New Empire!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3487078199" "Arachnos made some kind of shady deal recently... must have something to do with the attacks in Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LastriTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P657773880" "{Hero.gender=male Sir|Ma'am}, I've taken stock of the forces we have available. We now possess a strong enough ground force to match the Nemesis army in pure numerical terms, but...<br><br>I've been getting disturbing reports from my contacts in Paragon. Nemesis has been making more frequent use of the energy in Pandora's Box, and I'm not sure what his limits are. Based on these projections..."
// Answer Text :
"P320582245" "Then we need to take that power back, somehow."
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P110395788" "Agreed. We do have one possible advantage, in that we still possess the Antikythera artifact. The lab Nemesis used to absorb the power of Pandora's Box is based on the Antikythera's original design.<br><br>It may be possible to exploit that similarity somehow, but I believe it would necessitate a return to the lab itself."
// Answer Text :
"P2982632469" "You think there's something in there that could steal the power back?"
// Page Steal Text :
"P4031521541" "It's possible, and right now I think we're going to need every advantage we can get. According to these timetables, the mainstay of Paragon City's defenses will fall before the end of the week. If we allow Nemesis to establish full control of the city, his production rate will skyrocket, and..."
// Answer Text :
"P2055235956" "I get it, Lastri. I'll find something."
// Page Steal2 Text :
"P338670271" "<color orange>Lastri flushes sligthly, and nods.</color><br><br>Yes, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. My apologies.<br><br>Good luck, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ComputerTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P2675707233" "<color orange>This appears to be the control panel that Dr. Harvan used to bridge a connection between the lab's device and the Antikythera.<br><br>Readouts for capacity, stability, and energy flow fill the screen."
// Answer Text :
"P206106499" "Examine current energy capacity."
// Answer Text :
"P3708796943" "Run a stability diagnostic."
// Answer Text :
"P2919598318" "Manipulate the device's energy flow."
// Page FinalTree Text :
"P2683022538" "<color orange>This appears to be the control panel that Dr. Harvan used to bridge a connection between the lab's device and the Antikythera.<br><br>Readouts for capacity, stability, and energy flow fill the screen.<br><br><color yellow>You're still not sure what, exactly, this device is capable of. However, it's clear that if there's any way to make the device destroy itself, you'd have to use this control panel to make it happen."
// Page Capacity Text :
"P1862297198" "<color orange>The capacity readout opens a submenu on the screen:</color><br><br><color skyblue>ENERGY CAPACITY - 98.03%<BR><BR>ENERGY STORAGE LEVEL - 1.97%<BR><BR>MINIMUM ENERGY NECESSARY FOR CONNECTION PROCEDURE - 1.95%<BR><BR><color orange>It looks like there's barely enough energy left in the device to establish a second connection to the Antikythera. If you're going to use this device, you're only going to get one shot."
// Page FinalCapacity Text :
"P2568953245" "<color orange>The capacity readout opens a submenu on the screen:</color><br><br><color skyblue>ENERGY CAPACITY - 99.98%<BR><BR>ENERGY STORAGE LEVEL - 0.02%<BR><BR>MINIMUM ENERGY NECESSARY FOR CONNECTION PROCEDURE - 1.95%<BR><BR><color orange>It looks like the device's energy has been completely spent. It's doubtful you'll be able to successfully establish a connection with the Antikythera again, given the device's condition. Perhaps there's another way."
// Page Stability Text :
"P3477526229" "<color orange>The capacity readout opens a submenu on the screen:</color><br><br><color skyblue>FRAMEWORK STABILITY: 97.9% INTEGRITY<BR><BR>ENERGY CONTAINER STABILITY: 83.4% INTEGRITY<BR><BR>POWER SIPHON STABILITY: 48.8% INTEGRITY<BR><BR>WARNING: GENERAL STRUCTURAL DAMAGE DETECTED. ENERGY INTAKE PROCEDURE NOT RECOMMENDED.<BR><BR><COLOR ORANGE>Harvan's initial use of this device appears to have caused significant damage to its components. You're not sure you'd be able to repeat the process - if the device tried to forcibly re-absorb the energy from Pandora's Box, either the energy container or the power siphon could fail, with potentially catastrophic results."
// Answer Text :
"P2581416540" "Force the machine to re-absorb Pandora Energy."
// Page Flow Text :
"P795521311" "<color orange>The energy flow readout enlarges on the screen, displaying in detail the distribution of energy through the device's conduits. It appears that all of the power processed by this device is funneled through a single channel.<br><br>It also marks a display for the device's energy intake, which is merely labeled <color skyblue>EXTERNAL</color>. You can only assume that this refers to the Antikythera itself."
// Answer Text :
"P2167479832" "Set all energy conduits to 'Reverse Flow'"
// Page Flow2 Text :
"P1209397669" "<color orange>The small green arrows on the display, indicating energy flow direction, flip and turn yellow. Text appears on the screen:<br><br><color skyblue>ENERGY FLOW MODIFIED<BR><BR>NEW CONTAINER - [EXTERNAL DEVICE]</COLOR><BR><BR>At the bottom of the screen, a blinking red button appears containing a single query:<br><br><color skyblue>CONFIRM?<br><br><color orange>This procedure looks pretty involved. It's likely that any nearby Nemesis guards will take notice if you proceed."
// Answer Text :
"P278387999" "Press CANCEL"
// Answer Text :
"P2897118918" "Press CONFIRM"
// Page Force Text :
"P3584137703" "<color orange>The screen lights up with numerous bright red warnings and alerts:<br><br><color red>WARNING: STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY BELOW MINIMUM REQUIRED FOR PROCEDURE COMPLETION. ABSORPTION PROCEDURE IS NOT RECOMMENDED.<BR><BR><COLOR SKYBLUE>CONFIRM?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3782246308" "Helpful Tip #1: Remember, Lord Nemesis is not just a brilliant mind and military genius! He also wields the <i>power of the gods</i> - literally! He has infused his creations with the powers of an ancient Greek deity, making his forces completely unstoppable! Understanding this fact can bring relief, in knowing that you will always be safe as a citizen of the New Empire!<br><br>Helpful Tip #2: Lord Nemesis is not swayed by petty morality or squeamishness. He crushes all who oppose him! Bear in mind, this includes you. So if you're thinking about resisting the reign of your new overlord - don't!<br><br>Helpful Tip #3: Always remember to look your best when out in public. Lord Nemesis expects citizens of the New Empire to...<br><br><color orange>The power of the gods, indeed. Pandora's Box seems to be the key to Nemesis's victories in Paragon... perhaps if you were able to cut him off at the source, you'd be on more even ground. Lastri may be able to help you with coordinating such an operation."
// AcceptString :
"P2716979798" "I don't have time for this."
// SendOffString :
"P3102880727" "Every citizen has time for Lord Nemesis! He is, after all, the master of all he surveys. If you're planning on living on the planet Earth for the next few years, then being part of Lord Nemesis's New Empire is a reality you're going to need to get used to!<br><br>As always, if you need help adjusting to this new way of life, I'm available to answer any questions you may have!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3465228616" "<color deepskyblue>Part 2: Powers That Be</color>"

