"P1597105639" "Helpful Tip #17: Internal combustion engines run on gasoline, which is dirty and bad for the atmosphere! In the New Empire, citizens will be required to purchase and operate vehicles that use steam-powered engines. Steam technology is actually far superior in many ways..."

