// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 2 Caption :
"P1754034320" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>We've found {Hero.gender=male him|her}. {Hero.gender=male He|She} doesn't appear to be conscious."
// 2 Caption :
"P3374208766" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color khaki><bgcolor sienna>Is {Hero.gender=male he|she} injured? We can't afford to stay here much longer."
// 2 Caption :
"P1534786328" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>I don't believe so. Besides, the only medical facilities we have available are aboard the Mitscher."
// 2 Caption :
"P2432062002" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>Let's get {Hero.gender=male him|her} to the flier. We're done here."
// Script Variable ACTOR_2_NAME :
"P3062005348" "Player"
// Script Variable Actor19_Name :
"P1974627597" "Knockback Object"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3182278618" "Boss Name"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Name 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 0 Actor1 :
"P1775449068" "<Goto E11>"
// 4 Caption :
"P3431099224" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Lastri, it's me. How's your progress?"
// 5 Caption :
"P2647530390" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>We're nearly finished loading the supplies, sir. We'll be out of the Isles within the hour."
// 4 Caption :
"P1172554184" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Perfect. Would you say that your task was successful?"
// 6 Caption :
"P971951222" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>Absolutely, sir. The Illuminati have become a credible threat to Arachnos, which can only strengthen our position. I'd say we're more than ready for phase two."
// 5 Caption :
"P1682756948" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>That's not your call to make. What about {HeroName}? Will {Hero.gender=male he|she} become a problem?"
// 5 Caption :
"P4118400573" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>I don't believe so, sir. {HeroName}'s goals continue to align with ours, at least for the time being."
// 6 Caption :
"P3304210445" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>I don't recommend aggressive action. Any appearance of hostility would represent a... significant loss of resources, by my estimation."
// 4 Caption :
"P3774972377" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Ha... that sounded like respect. You haven't gotten attached, I hope?"
// 4 Caption :
"P1001025962" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon> {HeroName} is... remarkably effective at what {Hero.gender=male he|she} does, sir. In fact, with your permission, I'd like to-"
// 5 Caption :
"P159763047" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>It can't happen, Lastri. I need you here. When we start phase 2, I'm going to need a proxy to get anything done."
// 4 Caption :
"P1204195524" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>Of course, sir. Preparations for our departure are almost complete."
// 7 Caption :
"P394315619" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=8><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Fantastic. Now, if you don't mind, I have a party to attend. We finished off the Nemesis army today, and the mayor is hosting a celebration."
// 3 Caption :
"P2047365760" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>..."
// 0 Actor1 :
"P1804963253" "<Goto E12>"
// 3 Caption :
"P4210616456" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>Yes, sir. Have a good time, sir."
// 1 Caption :
"P2729107585" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Oh, I plan to. We'll talk later, Lastri, when you're stateside. Keep in touch."
// Script Variable ACTOR_2_NAME :
"P2011343611" "???"
// Script Variable ACTOR_3_NAME :
"P3786304718" "Warehouse Worker"

